    "implication": "The \"heartbeat\" seen on the hub C2H log is the periodic CAN->hub poll traffic (GET /ctoh/task every 10s, plus /rtoh/logs posts), not a dedicated heartbeat call. If the poll loop stops, the \"heartbeat\" disappears.",
